---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import disney from '../assets/brand/disney.svg';
import abc from '../assets/brand/abc.svg';
import zico from '../assets/brand/zico.svg';
import jamba from '../assets/brand/jamba.svg';
---
<BaseLayout title="Company" description="HardMagic Corporation is a privately owned Delaware agentic AI and media corporation building Studio, WireMark, HardMagic CLI, Web Magic, and related systems.">
  <section class="page-hero company-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow dark">HardMagic Corporation · Delaware, USA</p><h1>Agentic intelligence.<br />Creative <em>authority.</em></h1><p>Privately owned. Founder-led. Building owned systems for generative production, visual product intelligence, agent execution, and verifiable delivery.</p></section>
  <section class="company-story"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">The corporation now</p><h2>We join imagination, models, agents, infrastructure, and evidence in one accountable practice.</h2></div><div><p>HardMagic builds and operates products for people who need machine-scale creative and technical reach without losing human direction.</p><p>Studio generates across media. WireMark makes visual product intent executable. HardMagic CLI orchestrates bounded agent work. Web Magic verifies the public result. Each product stands alone; together they form a directed operating system.</p><p>More than twenty-five years of multidisciplinary practice inform how we build. They are the foundation beneath the current work, not its substitute.</p><a class="button ghost" href="products/">Explore the product system</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="principles shell section-pad"><p class="eyebrow dark">What endures</p><h2>Independent thinking.<br />Durable craft.</h2><div class="principle-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Human direction</h3><p>AI should extend taste and intention, never flatten them.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Real evidence</h3><p>Products earn trust by showing their work and naming their edges.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Connected systems</h3><p>The strongest experience joins story, interface, infrastructure, and delivery.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Private stewardship</h3><p>We build patiently, own our direction, and protect the work entrusted to us.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="brand-history"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Selected experience</p><h2>Our founder’s work crosses recognized stages, brands, media, products, and places.</h2><div class="logo-row"><img src={disney.src} alt="The Walt Disney Company" /><img src={abc.src} alt="ABC" /><img src={zico.src} alt="ZICO" /><img src={jamba.src} alt="Jamba" /></div><p class="quiet">Selected historical relationships and project experience. Official vector marks belong to their respective owners and do not imply current endorsement.</p><a class="text-link" href="portfolio/">Explore the creative-direction portfolio →</a></div></section>
  <section class="closing-cta shell section-pad"><p class="eyebrow dark">Work with HardMagic</p><h2>Bring us the system<br />that does not exist yet.</h2><a class="button dark-button" href="contact/">Start a conversation</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
